From: William Floyd <git@notmy.space>
Subject: [PATCH] starqltechn: add DisplayPort audio as its own use case

The board can now carry audio over DisplayPort, so describe it.

It is a separate verb rather than a device inside HiFi on purpose.
msm_dp_audio_prepare() refuses unless the display is powered on, and the
encoder is configured from hw_params, so that refusal lands during
PulseAudio's profile probe. ACP discards a whole profile when any one of its
mappings fails to open -- which is how the headset mic on a dead SLIMBUS
backend once took the speakers down with it -- so a DisplayPort device inside
HiFi would lose all audio whenever no display was attached. As its own verb
it fails harmlessly and HiFi is untouched.

MultiMedia5 carries it, MultiMedia1..4 being spoken for.
---
--- /dev/null
+++ b/ucm2/Samsung/starqltechn/DisplayPort.conf
@@ -0,0 +1,45 @@
+# DisplayPort audio for Samsung Galaxy S9 SM-G9600 (starqltechn).
+#
+# Deliberately a separate verb rather than a device inside HiFi.
+#
+# msm_dp_audio_prepare() refuses with -EINVAL unless the DisplayPort display is
+# powered on, and with the encoder now configured from hw_params that refusal
+# lands during PulseAudio's profile probe.  ACP discards an entire profile when
+# any one of its mappings fails to open, so a DisplayPort device inside HiFi
+# would take the speakers and microphones down with it every time no display
+# was attached -- which is most of the time.
+#
+# As its own verb it can fail harmlessly: selecting this profile without a
+# display simply does not work, and HiFi is untouched.
+#
+# MultiMedia5 is used because MultiMedia1..4 already belong to HiFi.
+
+SectionVerb {
+	EnableSequence [
+		cset "name='DISPLAY_PORT_RX Audio Mixer MultiMedia5' 1"
+	]
+
+	DisableSequence [
+		cset "name='DISPLAY_PORT_RX Audio Mixer MultiMedia5' 0"
+	]
+
+	Value {
+		TQ "HiFi"
+	}
+}
+
+SectionDevice."DisplayPort" {
+	Comment "DisplayPort display"
+
+	EnableSequence [
+	]
+
+	DisableSequence [
+	]
+
+	Value {
+		PlaybackPriority 10
+		PlaybackPCM "hw:${CardId},4" # MultiMedia5
+		PlaybackChannels 2
+	}
+}
--- a/ucm2/Samsung/starqltechn/starqltechn.conf
+++ b/ucm2/Samsung/starqltechn/starqltechn.conf
@@ -5,6 +5,11 @@
 	Comment "HiFi quality Music."
 }
 
+SectionUseCase."DisplayPort" {
+	File "/Samsung/starqltechn/DisplayPort.conf"
+	Comment "Audio over DisplayPort"
+}
+
 SectionUseCase."Voice Call" {
 	File "/Samsung/starqltechn/VoiceCall.conf"
 	Comment "Make a phone call"
